<title>HONG KONG: BT Fund Managers launches new unit trusts in HK.</title>
<headline>BT Fund Managers launches new unit trusts in HK.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Fund Managers Ltd said on Thursday it had launched a new range of unit trusts, the BT Investment Funds, in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>It said the five new funds -- U.S. Smaller Companies Fund, Latin American Equity Fund, Global High Yield Fund, Global Bond Fund and Managed Dollar Fund -- will provide access to investments that are not offered extensively in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>BT Fund Managers represents Bankers Trust's international fund management activities in Asia.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
